<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F9.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 9</span>. </span><span id="S5.F9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative comparison of intrinsic image decompositions of
